      "title": "Now 20% overvalued after recent price rise",
      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has risen 12% to ₹324. The fair value is estimated to be ₹269, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 10.0% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has grown by 11%. For the next 3 years, revenue is forecast to grow by 9.1% per annum. Earnings are also forecast to grow by 7.1% per annum over the same time period.",
