      "body": "Analysts have nudged their price target for Bank of Baroda higher from ₹323.65 to ₹330.94, citing updated assumptions around expected revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E levels. What's in the News United Forum of Bank Unions has given notice of a proposed strike on January 27, 2026, over various issues and demands, and the bank has indicated that while it is planning for smooth operations, branch and office functioning may still be affected if the strike goes ahead (Key Developments).",
